WEBVTT

00:47:59.987 --> 00:48:02.045
and what it means to be human.

00:48:02.069 --> 00:48:04.056
CA: Someone might listen to that, Kai-Fu,

00:48:04.080 --> 00:48:07.696
and say that sounds
beautiful and inspiring and idealistic.

00:48:07.720 --> 00:48:11.374
But you've turned it
into, really, quite an insightful way

00:48:11.398 --> 00:48:17.958
to think about jobs of the future
might yet scale in harmony with AI.

00:48:17.982 --> 00:48:20.191
I guess the two key things are,

00:48:20.215 --> 00:48:22.403
you're saying, pay attention to two axes.

00:48:22.427 --> 00:48:25.085
On the one hand, a creative axis:

00:48:25.109 --> 00:48:27.949
how creative is a job?

00:48:27.973 --> 00:48:31.783
Some people will say that AI
has the ability itself to be creative,